  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">오늘은 물이랑 소금물을 동시에 얼려보는 실험입니다!<br>흥미유발을 아래 사진과 같습니다!ㅎㅎ<br>(AI 생성 이미지입니다)</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7916bb7c6162eece62804b70f69b5aa22db87417\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7916bb7c6162eece62804b70f69b5aa22db87417\" data-origin-width=\"1920\" data-origin-height=\"1080\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">아래와 같이 실험 합니다!</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2f0cb209e38443f37e2b649ab791d37de2666e87\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2f0cb209e38443f37e2b649ab791d37de2666e87\" data-origin-width=\"1054\" data-origin-height=\"1481\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3ca08f505bd23785ae81b706b63e4dcec3ceb5fa\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3ca08f505bd23785ae81b706b63e4dcec3ceb5fa\" data-origin-width=\"1053\" data-origin-height=\"1465\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c2a7462c9a4f3f7a505a367347f6fcfd0dd4a224\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c2a7462c9a4f3f7a505a367347f6fcfd0dd4a224\" data-origin-width=\"1028\" data-origin-height=\"1474\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3c56f750999c188c56a9dad6453d758bc5cb5dea\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattac